      "summary_raw": "<p>Good morning, everyone. Tom Jones is out today, but the team at Poynter is keeping tabs on the latest media news and analysis. White House press secretary Karoline Leavitt will [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.poynter.org/commentary/2026/karoline-leavitt-steps-down-cnn-for-sale-forbes-editor-fired/\">Karoline Leavitt to step down as White House press secretary</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.poynter.org\">Poynter</a>.</p>",
